  "description": "Gives the claude CLI provider proper tool-calling: hosts the app's registered Lyntai ITools as an in-process localhost HTTP MCP server and points the CLI at it (--mcp-config), so the CLI's agent calls them natively. Opt-in via builder.AddClaudeCliMcpTools(). Uses Kestrel (ASP.NET Core) for the ephemeral, per-call, localhost-only host.",
